olate · 100 ml flavour inspiration 1"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/videos/dark-chocolate-4458588.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 1.777778; aspect-ratio: 1.777778" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" controls poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/stills/dark-chocolate-4458665.webp'); ?>" aria-label="TrufflElixir Dark Chocolate · 100 ml flavour inspiration 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/videos/dark-chocolate-4458665.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 1.777778; aspect-ratio: 1.777778" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" controls poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/stills/dark-chocolate-5515587.webp'); ?>" aria-label="TrufflElixir Dark Chocolate · 100 ml flavour inspiration 3"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/videos/dark-chocolate-5515587.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div><dl class="lux-seo-facts"><div><dt>系列 / Series</dt><dd>TrufflElixir</dd></div><div><dt>Product Type</dt><dd>Flavoured syrup</dd></div><div><dt>SKU</dt><dd>TE-ELX-100-023</dd></div><div><dt>EAN-13</dt><dd>0805698516723</dd></div><div><dt>Net Content</dt><dd>100 ml</dd></div><div><dt>Ingredients (supplier sheet)</dt><dd>Sugar, water, natural flavoring, natural truffle flavoring, cocoa extract.</dd></div><div><dt>Country of Origin</dt><dd>Italy</dd></div><div><dt>Manufacturer</dt><dd>Truffleat S.r.l.</dd></div><div><dt>Manufacturing Facility</dt><dd>Via Tuscania 9, 01028 Orte (VT), Italy</dd></div><div><dt>Storage</dt><dd>Store in a cool, dry place, protected from light.</dd></div><div><dt>Shelf Life</dt><dd>24 months; see the actual pack for production date and batch.</dd></div><div><dt>Allergen Advice</dt><dd>Allergen information awaits supplier confirmation; consult before use if allergic to any ingredient.</dd></div><div><dt>Provisional Nutrition (awaiting confirmation)</dt><dd>Per 100 ml: energy 1423 kJ / 340 kcal, protein 0 g, fat 0 g, carbohydrate 84.1 g, sodium approximately 12 mg. Subject to confirmation against the final product label.</dd></div></dl></section><section class="lux-reader-section lux-product-story-media"><h2>Product Information</h2><p>TrufflElixir dark chocolate syrup with natural truffle flavoring, made in Italy. Net content: 100 ml. This dark-chocolate syrup is made with sugar, water, natural flavouring, natural truffle flavouring and cocoa extract.</p><p>Cocoa brings a deeper bittersweet and roasted character, while the truffle flavouring adds a distinctive mushroom-like note. Use it in desserts, drinks or creative pairings built around cocoa and truffle.</p><div class="lux-product-videos lux-elixir-story-videos"><video style="" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" controls poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/stills/dark-chocolate-7015435.webp'); ?>" aria-label="TrufflElixir Dark Chocolate · 100 ml flavour inspiration 1"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/videos/dark-chocolate-7015435.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" controls poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/stills/dark-chocolate-7141506.webp'); ?>" aria-label="TrufflElixir Dark Chocolate · 100 ml flavour inspiration 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/truffelixir/videos/dark-chocolate-7141506.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="lux-product-video-notes"><p>Start with a small amount and adjust according to the sweetness of the dessert or drink. Add it at the final stage so both colour and flavour remain visible on the surface.</p><p>Keep the base flavour clear, then use the syrup as a final finish. This prevents the sweetness from covering the dessert or drink too early and lets the truffle note remain after the first taste.</p></div><div class="lux-product-storage-gallery"><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/syrup-01-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/syrup-01.webp'); ?>" alt="TrufflElixir Dark Chocolate · 100 ml · Serving inspiration 1"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/syrup-02-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/syrup-02.webp'); ?>" alt="TrufflElixir Dark Chocolate · 100 ml · Serving inspiration 2"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/syrup-03-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/syrup-03.webp'); ?>" alt="TrufflElixir Dark Chocolate · 100 ml · Serving inspiration 3"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/syrup-04-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/syrup-04.webp'); ?>" alt="TrufflElixir Dark Chocolate · 100 ml · Serving inspiration 4"></picture></div><div class="lux-product-storage-notes"><p>Refer to the bottle label for the specific storage conditions and after-opening period. Take the amount needed for use, close the cap promptly after use, and keep the bottle opening clean. The syrups can be added directly to drinks, desserts or dairy-based preparations, or drizzled in a small amount after plating.</p></div></section></div></section></article></main>
